 uch. All materials will be provided.\nChildren under 13 must be accompanie
 d by an adult.\nRegistration is required for this class and begins Novembe
 r 30\, 2026 at 12:30 pm.\nNote: Your spot will not be guaranteed after 5 m
 inutes of the start of the program.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe p
 ersonal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Librar
 y under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The
