DESCRIPTION:Get ready to dive into the exciting world of 3D printing and l
 earn more!\nPLA? SLS? FDM? STL? OBJ? Are you feeling lost? Do you think a 
 slicer is what you use for carrots? Come learn more about 3d Printing duri
 ng this 1.5 hour lecture\, where you can learn the basics of this widespre
 ad technology.\nRegistration starts on December 9\, 2026 @ 12:30pm.\nInfor
 mation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collec
