DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261210T173000
UID:6ada7461fee2d21deb2522cc@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Explore mindfulness practices that support emotional well-bein
 g\, focus\, and self-awareness while experimenting with art-based exercise
 s that encourage reflection and stress reduction. No prior experience wit
 h mindfulness or art is required. Supplies will be provided.\nRegistration
  recommended. Drop-ins are welcome\nThis workshop is part of the Teen Soci
 al Health and Wellness programming. Generously supported by The Estate of 
 Claudia Krawchuk.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informatio
 n on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public
  Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will 
