BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Photo Editing with Adobe Photoshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261207T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261207T143000
UID:6aff6b1e8b254c003ada8cb2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Get started on the basics of using Adobe Photoshop\, the indus
 try standard software for photo editing. In this class\, you will:\nLearn 
 how to navigate the Photoshop workspace\, menus and options\nUse essential
  tools in Photoshop Toolbox: Crop\, Move\, Clone Stamp\, Healing Brush\nIm
 prove the look of photos with adjustments for Levels\, Brightness\, Contra
 st\, Colour Balance\nCreate a simple business card with Layers\, Text\, Co
 lour and a Logo\nPrerequisites\n: Mouse and keyboarding skills required.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, 2nd Floor\, Far back room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aff6b1e8b254c003ada8cb2
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
